For the panel to actually show a data, you need to put query under the query tab inside panel editor. make sure the query name is exactly as shown in this file.

note : if the query is not returning any value, it will show as a "-" on the value.

Query :
1. Disk Usage Percentage :
Query name : usage_pct
Query : (sum(longhorn_disk_usage_bytes) / sum(longhorn_disk_capacity_bytes)) * 100

2. Disk Used :
Query name : used
Query : sum(longhorn_disk_usage_bytes)

3. Disk Capacity :
Query name : capacity
Query : sum(longhorn_disk_capacity_bytes)
